    "display_name": "Transit Stops",
    "long_instructions": "## Examine the Display\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Run the app and look at the stops displayed.\r\n2. Compare the stops shown to the full `stops` array in the code.\r\n3. Look for patterns in what is shown.\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n\r\n- What stops are shown in the app?\r\n- Does the app show all stops in the dataset?\r\n- How is what you see different from the full dataset?\r\n- What might a user assume based on what is shown?",
